    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd86 WELCOME TO SUPERMARKET DUCK DASH! \ud83d\uded2</strong><br>A <strong>hilarious, physics-based shopping game</strong> where you play as a <strong>chaotic supermarket duck</strong> on a mission to knock as many items off the shelves as possible! Help grumpy old folks by collecting groceries\u2014but with <strong>only your wings</strong> to grab them, things are bound to go wrong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Your goal?</strong> Complete shopping lists, rack up the biggest score, and cause <strong>maximum supermarket destruction</strong> before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166480/extras/363a63f4d1be0eafb314e317307baf67.avif?t=1739465792\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f 3 Quacking Game Modes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Arcade Mode</strong> \u2013 Help as many old customers as possible before the timer hits zero!<br>\u26a1 <strong>Speed Dash</strong> \u2013 One chance, one cart\u2014get the <strong>highest receipt total</strong> in a single run!<br>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Destruction Mode</strong> \u2013 Forget the shopping list\u2014<strong>knock EVERYTHING</strong> off the shelves before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166480/extras/86ca0aa668de662d4e60200dd4a19269.avif?t=1739465792\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udd86 Features That Will Make You Quack!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>125+ products</strong> to grab, fling, and smash!<br>\u2705 <strong>Ridiculous physics</strong> for maximum chaos!<br>\u2705 <strong>3 quack buttons</strong>\u2014because sometimes words aren\u2019t enough!<br>\u2705 <strong>Spotty teenagers, grumpy old folks, and large fruit!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Endless replayability</strong>\u2014beat your best score and master the art of shopping destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>How much money can YOU make before time runs out?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Wishlist now and join the supermarket madness!</strong></p>",
