nagers, grumpy old folks, and large fruit!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Endless replayability</strong>\u2014beat your best score and master the art of shopping destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>How much money can YOU make before time runs out?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Wishlist now and join the supermarket madness!</strong></p>",
